#38300
A Shadowy Lair~
    This room is almost blanketed with darkness, the only light that
can be seen is emitted from a glowing orb hovering in the center of the
room.  The orb's light barely silhouettes the dark form of Cloak.  The walls
are covered with scrolls in ancient writings of darkness and shadows.  You
realize that you are in his domain and he has full control of this misty
realm.
