#38301
In Front of the Castle~
   Here is a huge castle, its silver walls gleaming in the sunlight.
The top of the castle is lined with archers with loaded bows, ready to
fire at any intruders.  The glinting tips of arrows can be seen through
slits in the castle walls.  Banners on the top of the castle wave wildly
in the strong winds.  A large oak drawbridge sits directly in front of
you, and the Emperor's road runs back down the hill to the south.
