#38302
Inside of the Castle~
   Inside the mighty castle of Llyndyr there are racks of weapons on the
walls and ancient, battle-worn suits of armor in each corner of the
room.  Scrolls and tapestries from another era line the walls, telling
ancient tales of warriors and mages.  The room is lit by torches that
sit in golden holders.  Two statues of dragons flank the entrance to a
very long hallway to the north, and a narrow stair climbs to the
battlements.
